{"des":"琦莉可的忧郁-雪域探险家露莉亚互动","script":"s_5_7_2","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]域外之人？我从来没有听说过这种传说啊？你是从哪里听来的？可以简单介绍一下吗？[l][cm]","charaName":"雪域探险家露莉亚"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这是我从这么多天的思考中得到的启示，或许也是域外之人通过这种方式告诉我的。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生琦莉可"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]域外之人从未显露过真身，他们在卡露蒂亚上只是以投影行动。这个神秘组织常在人迹罕至之地出没，记录当地的发展状况！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生琦莉可"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]没有人见识过他们的真实面目，据说他们的外形和声音都在不断变化。毕竟他们是高维生物，我们无法理解关于他们的任何事情！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生琦莉可"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]你们想想，这世间这么多奇幻的故事难道都是巧合吗？黄昏的灾变、兽潮的爆发、火山变成雪原，这些有没有可能是人为制造的呢？[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生琦莉可"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0.4,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_7"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]合着这都是你自己的胡思乱想啊……那你打算用什么方法来证明域外之人的存在呢？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_8"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]虽然他们很少露面，但从我的感知来看，他们最近一定在这霜烬平原附近出没！我们只要在周围找找，就能发现他们！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生琦莉可"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_9"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]……这……[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_10"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]额……你说的这种特征的人，我似乎还真的有线索。[l][cm]","charaName":"雪域探险家露莉亚"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_11"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]露莉亚小姐，你真的有线索吗？[l][cm]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_12"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]算是吧，毕竟我们探险家的消息还是挺灵通的。听说沉星冰湖下游有群奇怪的人出没，他们穿着黑袍集体行动。[l][cm]","charaName":"雪域探险家露莉亚"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_13"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]黑袍……！没错，他们绝对有可能穿着黑袍行动！太棒了！真是想什么来什么，那我们直接去那边调查就好了！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生琦莉可"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_14"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这个也没法确定啦，都只是一些传言罢了。就算真有这么一批人，我也不能保证他们就是你所说的域外之人。[l][cm]","charaName":"雪域探险家露莉亚"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_15"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]没事，只要有线索就好！我们现在就出发吧！去沉星冰湖！等见到域外之人，我要好好跟他们聊聊。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生琦莉可"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_16"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]呃……就算真有这么些人存在，你想和他们聊什么呢？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_17"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]让我们探讨一些经典的哲学命题：我是谁？我从何处来？将往何处去？啊，他们会如何作答？真是想想就令人激动！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生琦莉可"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_18"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]行吧……如果能解开你的心结，那也无所谓了。但无论结果如何，调查结束后你都得好好跟教授他们道歉才行。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_19"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2q","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]请放心，我这几天只是对域外之人感到好奇才不怎么说话。只要能展开调查解开我的心结，我就不会再纠结了。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生琦莉可"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_20"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":1,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]好的，我们走吧。[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_21"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","transTime":300,"x":50,"y":-180,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","transTime":300,"x":510,"y":-416,"bright":0.6,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"addImg":"","alpha":0,"noIn":false,"scaleX":1.5,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","transTime":300,"x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[hide]","charaName":""}},{"key":"end","para":{"end":true}}]}